From 1fd4062400d38372b369e59a61912589937dfa1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDave94 <61838748+TheDave94@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:48:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] test(sonification): pitch bake-off phase 2 harness -
 scenario + metric API (BENCH-P)

Re-applies the r17 bake-off harness (BENCH.patch) on main and extends it
for the phoneme pitch-shift bake-off (BAKEOFF-PITCH.md section 4):
- BakeoffCandidates: name + factory entries built from the production
  SonificationSource (gain, recorded onset); 'ours' = the shipped TDPSOLA
  exactly as LiveSonificationAudio.makeRenderer; NaiveResample anchor.
  AppleTimePitch is not re-applied (AVAudio graph in the app module).
- PitchScenarios: held +-300/+-600/0, steps 0->+-600 and +600->-600,
  the phase-1 +-600 triangle sweep, rates 0.5/1/2, r26 height trajectory.
- PitchMetrics (Swift/vDSP port of metrics_r27.py / measure.py): true
  envelope warp alpha, LSD, frame-wise LSD, jitter/shimmer from marks,
  F wobble / comb / level, local click ratio.
- PitchGates (section 3 thresholds), PitchRunner, bench mode 'pitch'
  writing bench.csv, gates.csv and the MUSHRA renders.
- Calibration CLI, report and collect scripts under scripts/pitch_bakeoff.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
